# Rules Maintenance Guide

When making code changes, check if any Cursor rules need updating. Stale rules produce stale AI output.

## Trigger Checklist

| Change Type | Rule(s) to Update |
|-------------|-------------------|
| New service/port added | `project-overview.mdc` (ports table, proxy rules), root `README.md` |
| New agent created | `project-overview.mdc`, `python-agents.mdc` (if patterns change), `README.md` (ports/env) |
| New env variable | `docker-deploy.mdc` (if in Compose), `README.md` (env vars section) |
| New API endpoint on workspace-svc | `go-services.mdc` (if pattern deviates) |
| Vite proxy rule changed | `project-overview.mdc` (proxy table) |
| New WebSocket event type | `project-overview.mdc` (event lists) |
| New Tailwind token in `@theme` | `design-system.mdc` (color table) |
| New i18n key namespace | `frontend-i18n.mdc` (key naming examples) |
| New shared Go model | `project-overview.mdc`, `go-services.mdc` |
| New Python tool class | `python-agents.mdc` (if new pattern) |
| New Zustand store | `frontend-react.mdc` (store naming) |
| Redis DB index allocated | `docker-deploy.mdc`, `README.md` (Redis DB table) |
| Migration added | `docker-deploy.mdc` (migration numbering) |
| Docker Compose service added | `docker-deploy.mdc`, `README.md` |

## How to Update

1. Read the existing rule file
2. Update only the sections affected by the change
3. Keep rules concise — under 50 lines of content per rule
4. Add concrete examples for new patterns, not just descriptions
5. Run `ls .cursor/rules/` to verify all rules are present

## Rule File Inventory

| File | Scope | What it covers |
|------|-------|---------------|
| `project-overview.mdc` | Always | Architecture, ports, events, module refs |
| `go-services.mdc` | `services/**/*.go` | Chi router, handler/service/store layering |
| `python-agents.mdc` | `agents/**/*.py, platform/**/*.py` | BaseAgent, BaseTool, FastAPI lifespan |
| `frontend-react.mdc` | `apps/web/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` | Components, Zustand stores, Tailwind tokens |
| `frontend-i18n.mdc` | `apps/web/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}` | Dictionary keys, `useT()`, key naming |
| `design-system.mdc` | `apps/web/src/**/*.{css,tsx}` | Color tokens, utility classes, fonts |
| `docker-deploy.mdc` | `deploy/**` | Compose naming, env vars, migrations |
| `rules-maintenance.mdc` | Always | This file — when to update other rules |
